SUMMARY:N64 Mario Kart Tournaments
DESCRIPTION:Show off your N64 skills every last Thursday of each month. From 7 – 9pm we’ll be hosting up to 16 players for a sweet bracket tournament of 1996’s Mario Kart 64. First come\, first play so get here early\, grab your drink\, and sign up to play your heart out. Must purchase a beverage to enter tournament\, so come thirsty! \nView on Facebook.\nHappens on the following Dates:\nAug 27\, 2026\, 7:00pm to 9:00pm Timezone: Eastern Time (US & Canada)\nSep 24\, 2026\, 7:00pm to 9:00pm Timezone: Eastern Time (US & Canada)\nOct 29\, 2026\, 7:00pm to 9:00pm Timezone: Eastern Time (US & Canada)\nNov 26\, 2026\, 7:00pm to 9:00pm Timezone: Eastern Time (US & Canada)
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/n64-mario-kart-tournaments/2026-08-27/
LOCATION:Glass Jug Downtown\, 545 Foster Street\, Suite 10\, Durham\, 27701
