SUMMARY:Classic Bingo Night @ DSSOLVR! (Free - Win Drinks & Lottery Tickets!)
DESCRIPTION:Bingo Night @ DSSOLVR Durham hosted by Bingo Geeks NC.\nThink you’ve got the winning card? Join us for FREE-TO-PLAY BINGO\, every Wednesday at 7pm\, where the prizes are real\, the drinks are flowin’\, and the vibes are immaculate. \n5 rounds. Prizes include free drink tickets and scratch off lottery tickets\n$6 sours & $6 ciders all day long\nGood beer\, great times\, and absolute chaos \nNo cover\, no excuses—just show up\, grab a drink\, and let’s get lucky! \nDSSOLVR Info: \nWi-Fi – Free guest Wi-Fi available.\nMenu – Menu has rotating options of beer\, liquor/cocktails\, cider\, Gluten free beers\, hard ginger beer\, Jell-O shots\, and extensive non-alcoholic offerings!TVs – 4 TVs – request to put on any game or show!\nDogs – Dog Friendly inside taproom & outside on covered patio (we have toys\, beds\, & water bowls!)\nFamily – Family friendly w/ high chair\, changing table\, and sensory toys for kids.\nGames – Free to play board games\, N64\, NES\, and arcade games\nFood – Snacks & cup of noodles available on site. Several food delivery & carry out options available within a 2 block radius.\nParking – Standard downtown parking options available. Street parking all around (free after 7 pm and on Sat/Sun. Free gravel parking lot next to Welcome tattoo. Free parking along residential streets back towards Durty Bull. Paid parking lots in Liberty Apartment building and next to Geer House Apartments.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/classic-bingo-night-dssolvr-free-win-drinks-lottery-tickets/2026-09-16/
