DESCRIPTION:Free wine and sake tastings in the izakaya this September! Join us Thursdays from 5:30–7pm to sip\, learn a little\, and maybe stick around for dinner while you’re here. 🥢 \nSeptember 3 — Marie Aulino\, Winebow\nSeptember 10 — Warren Oster\, Advintage Distributing\nSeptember 17 — Thomas Stallings\, Tryon Distributing \nEach week\, we’ll be pouring a mix of wine and sake and sharing a little more about what’s in your glass. No ticket needed—just come upstairs and taste! ✨
