SUMMARY:CULT YOUR NIGHT PRESENTS: A MORE PERFECT ANARCHY A Sacred Cabaret for Constitution Day
DESCRIPTION:“The experiment remains unfinished.”\nFor 250 years\, we’ve lived inside a document written by a room full of powerful men imagining a nation into existence. Some of those ideas changed the world. Some left entire communities outside the room.\nTwo hundred and fifty years later\, we’re gathering again\, not to tear the Constitution apart\, but to ask: \nWhat deserves amendment now? \nThis Constitution Day\, Cult Your Night invites performers\, poets\, dancers\, musicians\, drag artists\, aerialists\, storytellers\, comedians\, ritual-makers\, and glorious troublemakers to help draft the next chapter. \nTonight we explore\nJoy as resistance\, and the beautiful chaos of becoming. \nAnd yes… It’s time for the wisdom we’ve called too emotional\, too soft\, too loud\, too witchy\, too nurturing\, too sensual\, too inconvenient to take its seat at the convention. \nLet the divine feminine.\nLet the sacred masculine.\nLet the ancestors.\nLet the artists.\nLet the outcasts.\nLet everyone who has ever been told they didn’t belong in the room… \n…help amend some shit. \nCome bear witness. It’s burlesque. drag. aerial. fire. poetry. music. rage. tenderness A Night to bring forth the version of America you’ve been carrying inside you. \nThe experiment remains unfinished. \nLet’s write the next draft.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/cult-your-night-presents-a-more-perfect-anarchy-a-sacred-cabaret-for-constitution-day/
LOCATION:Durty Bull Brewing Company\, 206 Broadway Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults Only,Live Performance
