SUMMARY:Iron Heroes & Iron Pour Kickoff Party - Third Friday at the Foundry
DESCRIPTION:The Iron Pour Kick off Party is BACK ON after postponing due to weather. Join Liberty Arts on September 18th from 6 to 9 PM at the Foundry in Durham Central Park to celebrate all things Iron Pour!\nWe’ll combine celebrations this month with the Iron Heroes Kick off Party!\nLiberty Arts is celebrating its 10th year of the Iron Pour this November\, and the party starts now! Join us at the Liberty Arts Foundry in Durham Central Park for our 10th Anniversary kick off party! Learn more about the Iron Pour by chatting with members of our Pour team and taking part in various educational workshops. We’ll also be hosting our first Iron Pour Relief Sculpture class! Plus\, learn about all the associated Iron Pour Programming we have planned leading up to November.\nIron Pour Relief Sculpture Workshop: Carve designs into blocks of resin-bonded sand. In November at the 10th Annual Liberty Arts Iron Pour\, watch your creation become a work of art! **Separate Registration required. Sign up now on our broader events page!\nLearn More about the Pour: Hang out inside the foundry and chat with our Pour Master Tripp Jarvis and Furnace Captain Kimberly Foytlin-Zhang about what happens on the Pour Floor. Watch exclusive videos from the pour teams and learn about what we have in store for this year!\nBott Making Activity: Learn to make “botts\,” a crucial part of the pouring process\, using sand\, clay\, sawdust\, and water. Free to participate and open to all ages (with guardian supervision)!\nPlaque Design Contest: Turn in your last minute submissions for the 10th Anniversary Plaque Design Contest! Use our template worksheet to design a plaque inspired by all things ART and FIRE. If your submission is selected\, your work will be cast in iron during the 10th Annual Iron Pour\, and the plaque will be installed on our Foundry in Durham Central Park!\nDress like the Pros: Try on a full set of leathers worn by members of the Pour Crew!\nIron Pour Merch: Get ready for November by shopping our Iron Pour Merch selection! Pick up hats\, t shirts\, magnets\, crewnecks and more!\nIron Works on Display: Check out work made by artists from previous Iron Pours!\nAND\, as part of the Iron Heroes Kick off Party:\nIron Heroes Artists: Chat with alumni Iron Heroes artists and learn more about the upcoming fall cohort!\nCraft Mask Making Workshop: Get inspired by the iron and aluminum masks made by the Iron Heroes by creating a mask of your own! $10 per mask. All proceeds support the continuation of the Iron Heroes Program. Reservation required. Sign up now!\nBe ready to party!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/iron-heroes-iron-pour-kickoff-party-third-friday-at-the-foundry/
LOCATION:Liberty Arts Foundry\, 538 Foster Street\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Art,Classes & Workshops,Free,Third Friday
